/E (AI Tutoring Assistant \(Limited Risk with elevated governance\): LLM-specific governance applied. Red team testing revealed edge cases with misleading academic content and prompt injection vulnerabilities. Remediation: output guardrails, content verification layer, input sanitization, human escalation mechanism. Special testing for cultural sensitivity across Indian, US, and European user contexts.)
