/Title (Technical Complexity. Modern AI systems, particularly large language models and generative AI, operate with complexity that challenges traditional governance approaches. The "black box" nature of deep learning models makes it difficult to explain decisions, detect biases, or assign accountability. As organizations deploy increasingly sophisticated AI across critical processes, governance challenges grow proportionally.)
